This is a field-deployment recipe companion to:
  - jayleaton/deepseek-v41-tensorfold-spark (Apache-2.0) — the upstream recipe,
    the flash17 EXL3 pack tooling docs, engine/zig CUDA source, and launcher.
  - ashhart/TensorFold (Apache-2.0) — the engine framework; the grafted kernel in
    fixes/tf102-exl3-prefill/prefill.py is taken verbatim from TensorFold 0.6.0
    (src/tensorfold/cuda/exl3/prefill.py).
  - deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 — the base model (own license terms).
  - MiaAI-Lab's 2x DGX Spark kits — reference for the cluster layout.
The grafted file is unchanged apart from its docstring, which explains why it
is grafted. All engine, image, weights and upstream docs keep their own terms:
see the upstream repository's docs/LICENSING.md.
